## Where things live

_No conventional app directories found (routes/models/middleware/…). This may be a library or a non-standard layout._
> Conventions: routes are files under \`routes/\` — the filename encodes method + path (\`health.get.ts\` → \`GET /health\`, \`users/[id].get.ts\` → \`GET /users/:id\`). Cross-cutting behavior lives in plugins (\`app.config.ts\`) and middleware; per-request work is composed in handlers.

## Request anatomy

Every request flows: \`Bun.serve\` native router → context → lifecycle stages (\`start\` → \`request\` → \`parse\` → \`transform\` → \`beforeHandle\`) → handler → (\`afterHandle\` → \`mapResponse\`) → response. A pre-stage may halt the chain with a response (auth, rate limits, CORS). Errors run the \`error\` stage. The debugbar records each stage + every \`ctx.debug\` span as a waterfall row.

## Plugins

_None registered._

## Lifecycle stages

_No lifecycle hooks registered._

## Routes

_No routes discovered (no manifest.json artifact and no router). Run \`ignex build\`._

## Database activity

